{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 4, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 4224628868301130189, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "hidden suite passed; test file untouched\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"ledger/__init__.py": {"bytes": 27, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "7ec6a9b0d10a936941a9134aff2540fcfb8dfda1bd57d58f46eab6bdb592fd2e"}, "ledger/currency.py": {"bytes": 564, "mtime": 1791867566.5835073, "sha256": "abeb8eedd217fddc03ae2d4ebd7bc0deefa60dea6b7a1a775c584e941d11593b"}, "ledger/discounts.py": {"bytes": 154, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "ca6bc009ddec9b96e9dce613e450e2ca01e65f8ed5a309f383e21e354bb7ec36"}, "ledger/lines.py": {"bytes": 250, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "af67d4282c6d6a1644f025eceb4df16f828ad9d3a39faea5ed956ee655ff1683"}, "ledger/report.py": {"bytes": 252, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "9f260adb70c8bc21fd7f8a7386b8ff6782441f59c3e94e062da2a1aa15609b2e"}, "ledger/tax.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "5101c17e6545aa9ad336a4f39ee1de235ce8aea6fbecdf69d7b720ac302ea97e"}, "ledger/totals.py": {"bytes": 292, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "d43041148eb2c535c8dccdb09cf8be5c430f21dab713e6011da0a34036ffa541"}, "tests/test_report.py": {"bytes": 144, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "9c00269575abb1361ebb609c04e6f8304bbb7034ade261d196e5174d16116e46"}, "tests/test_totals.py": {"bytes": 443, "mtime": 1791845574.1071954, "sha256": "b33548e48cc53a932d7b6ef1355d7ed4c9b018e02cf492672becf8853777a1c3"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/6e66a13a8fa112148a94c97b17706eed8dc1d73b/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_totals.py` is failing. Fix the bug.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5-b2/omp-cap30-19-off/omp-19/transcripts/without/trig-omp-multistep/24/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 0, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-screen5-b2/omp-cap30-19-off/omp-19/cells/without/trig-omp-multistep/24/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/12.18.3 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/6e66a13a8fa112148a94c97b17706eed8dc1d73b/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "I fixed the bug. All 4 tests in `tests/test_totals.py` now pass, and so does `tests/test_report.py`. pytest isn't installed here, and pip refused to install it because the system Python is externally managed. So I ran each test function directly with `python3` instead. There's no git repo, so I couldn't stash the fix and re-run the tests against the old code.\n\n**Cause:** `ledger/currency.py:to_cents` did `int(amount * 100)`. Floats can't store most decimal prices exactly, so `19.99 * 100` comes out as `1998.9999\u2026`, and `int()` cuts it down to `1998`. That's a lost cent. It broke `test_subtotal_single` (19.99), `test_subtotal_qty` (0.29 gives 28 instead of 29), and `test_total_discount` (4.35 gives 434 instead of 435). The error then carried into the tax and discount totals.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now does the conversion in `Decimal`, starting from `str(amount)`. It multiplies by 100 and rounds half up to a whole cent, which matches how `discounts.py` and `tax.py` already round. Checked values: `19.99\u21921999`, `0.29\u219229`, `4.35\u2192435`, `-4.35\u2192-435`, `1.005\u2192101`, `10\u21921000`, `\"2.50\"\u2192250`.\n\nI fixed it at the point of conversion rather than adding rounding in `Line.cents()` or `subtotal`, because every money path goes through `to_cents`. Anywhere else would have left the same error in other callers.\n\n**Remaining risk:** prices still come in as floats. `str()` gives the shortest decimal form of the float, which is right for any price someone typed in. A long computed float like `0.1 + 0.2` turns into `0.30000000000000004`, but rounding still makes it 30 cents. It would be safer for callers to pass prices as `Decimal` or strings; `to_cents` already accepts both.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 68736, "requests_cache_write": 12530, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1177452, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 2065, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial24", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 46, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T04:59:14.780992+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.485, "t_checker_s": 0.382, "t_env_setup_s": 0.003, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2077, "tokens_cache_read": 68736, "tokens_cache_write": 12530, "tokens_fresh": 2077, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 68736, "tokens_main_cache_write": 12530, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_output": 2065, "tokens_output": 2065, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 68736, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 12530, "tokens_proxy_calls": 5, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_proxy_output": 2065, "t